        "source": "kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Siri Remote. The Siri Remote is a remote control device released in tandem with the 4th Generation Apple TV at an Apple Keynote Address by CEO Tim Cook on October 26, 2015 by Apple Inc. The Remote is designed specifically to work with the always-on Siri capable Apple TV. The device is a successor of the original Apple Remote. It is also compatible with the Apple TV 4K.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.999999991489881,
